  "rationale": "50 units of Flavoured Milk 200G at Dark store 08 (East Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the online sell-by deadline on 2026-09-19; doing nothing writes off ₹7450 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹4846. This play uses a bundle with SKU-MULTIGRAIN-BREAD-400G at ₹235 for 314 consented customers (Tea connoisseurs, Dairy occasionals, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Festival sweets loyalists, Personal care regulars): expected 36 units, margin ₹736, discount cost ₹1426, waste avoided ₹5311 (CI 2 to 104 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the flavoured milk with Multigrain Bread 400G at a bundle price of INR 235.0, which complies with the 8.0% dairy margin floor and recovers INR 6047.04, beating the markdown threshold within tolerance.",
